{
  "_comment": [
    "Piece names used by rulesets/, mapped to icon slugs in manifest.json.",
    "Names are matched case-insensitively. This file is hand-maintained, not",
    "generated: it is a judgement about what a piece looks like, not about what",
    "it does. An unmapped name is not an error -- fall back to the spec letter,",
    "which is what chess_variant_sandbox/viz already draws.",
    "",
    "Nothing in the engine reads this. It exists so a renderer can pick an icon",
    "without hardcoding chess, and so a proposal that invents 'schleich' gets a",
    "pawn rather than a blank square."
  ],

